{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"principal-missing-emu","creation_channel":"mcp","description":"# Intermittent bridge_run_failures during 2026-08-26->28 sweep window\n\n## Impact\nThe reconcile-bridge recorded **5 isolated single-hour failures** over the sweep window. Each\nself-cleared, so no sustained outage, but the pattern is recurring and there is no open ticket\ntracking it. Unlike the closed sustained-outage bug eab8 (exceedable-giant-mussel, a pydantic\n`SecretStr` import regression fixed 2026-08-18), these are sparse transient failures with a\ndifferent signature.\n\n## Evidence — CloudWatch (rebar/host:bridge_run_failures, Sum>0 per hour, PDT)\n- 2026-08-26 20:00\n- 2026-08-27 15:00\n- 2026-08-27 19:00\n- 2026-08-27 22:00\n- 2026-08-28 01:00\n\nAlarm `rebar-bridge-run-failures` (2-of-2 hourly datapoints > 0) flapped ALARM->OK three times:\n- 08-27 19:09 -> 19:47 PDT\n- 08-27 22:10 -> 23:09 PDT\n- 08-28 01:12 -> 02:10 PDT\n\n## Root-cause status\nUNKNOWN — the box does not ship bridge logs to CloudWatch Logs in us-east-1 (only lmn-*/snap-*\nlog groups exist), so the failing reconcile passes cannot be root-caused from CloudWatch alone.\nNote some of these hours overlap the box-wide disk-fill / disk-pressure incident (see the\ngerrit-data-disk-high bug), so bridge runs may have failed under disk pressure — worth checking\nwhether these failures correlate with reclaim/pressure events on the box.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Pull the reconcile-bridge journald/log lines for the 5 timestamps above and classify the\n      failure(s).\n- [ ] Determine whether they are disk-pressure-induced (correlate with the data-disk incident)\n      or an independent transient (network/Jira/auth), and fix the class or document as benign.\n\n## Notes\nFiled by a READ-ONLY AWS ops sweep; no AWS mutation performed.\n","id":"97e2-5165-38c2-4d9b","parent_id":"","priority":3,"tags":["ops","aws-sweep","bridge","reconciler"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"[bridge-run-failures] Intermittent reconcile-bridge failures: 5 isolated hourly failures over 2026-08-26->28 (alarm flapped 3×)"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788023687157783739,"uuid":"6fee2185-cb35-475e-bd3a-669eb9709254"}